sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Sales Rep
    participant LWC as Dashboard LWC
    participant Apex as Apex Controller
    participant DB as Salesforce DB
    participant DetailPage as Record Detail Page

    User->>LWC: Access Dashboard
    LWC->>Apex: Request Account & Opportunity Data
    Apex->>DB: Query Accounts with Custom Fields
    DB-->>Apex: Return Account Records
    Apex->>DB: Query Opportunities with Custom Fields
    DB-->>Apex: Return Opportunity Records
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Filtered Data
    LWC->>LWC: Render Dashboard with Metrics
    LWC->>LWC: Display Summary Statistics
    
    User->>LWC: Apply Filters (Tier, Industry, Stage)
    LWC->>Apex: Request Filtered Data
    Apex->>DB: Query with Filter Criteria
    DB-->>Apex: Return Filtered Records
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Results
    LWC->>LWC: Update Dashboard Display
    
    User->>LWC: Search for Record
    LWC->>Apex: Execute Search Query
    Apex->>DB: Search Accounts/Opportunities
    DB-->>Apex: Return Search Results
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Matching Records
    LWC->>LWC: Display Search Results
    
    User->>LWC: Click on Account/Opportunity
    LWC->>DetailPage: Navigate to Record Detail
    DetailPage->>DB: Load Record Data
    DB-->>DetailPage: Return Full Record
    DetailPage->>User: Display Record Details
    
    User->>LWC: Access Contact Management
    LWC->>Apex: Request Contact Data
    Apex->>DB: Query Contacts with Relationships
    DB-->>Apex: Return Contact Records
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Contact Data
    LWC->>LWC: Display Contacts Grouped by Account
    
    User->>LWC: Filter Contacts (Role, Engagement)
    LWC->>Apex: Request Filtered Contacts
    Apex->>DB: Query with Contact Filters
    DB-->>Apex: Return Filtered Contacts
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Results
    LWC->>LWC: Update Contact Display
    
    User->>LWC: Click LinkedIn Profile Link
    LWC->>User: Open External LinkedIn Profile
    
    User->>LWC: Execute Quick Action (Log Call/Email)
    LWC->>Apex: Create Activity Record
    Apex->>DB: Insert Call/Email Log
    DB-->>Apex: Confirm Creation
    Apex-->>LWC: Return Success
    LWC->>User: Display Confirmation